<item rdf:about="https://www.bankofcanada.ca/2026/11/parliamentary-appearance-governor-senior-deputy-governor-bank-canada-2026-11-5/">
    <title>Parliamentary Appearance by the Governor and the Senior Deputy Governor of the Bank of Canada</title>
    <link>https://www.bankofcanada.ca/2026/11/parliamentary-appearance-governor-senior-deputy-governor-bank-canada-2026-11-5/</link>
    <description>On Thursday, November 5, 2026, the Governor of the Bank of Canada, Tiff Macklem, will appear before the Standing Senate Committee on Banking, Commerce and the Economy. He will be accompanied by Senior Deputy Governor Carolyn Rogers.</description>
    <dc:date>2026-11-05T10:30:36+00:00</dc:date>
    <dc:language>en</dc:language>

        <cb:event rdf:parseType="Resource">
            <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.cbwiki.net/wiki/index.php/RSS-CB_1.2_RDF_Schema#Event"/>
            <cb:simpleTitle>Parliamentary Appearance by the Governor and the Senior Deputy Governor of the Bank of Canada</cb:simpleTitle>
            <cb:occurrenceDate>2026-11-05</cb:occurrenceDate>
        </cb:event>
</item>
