<item rdf:about="https://www.bankofcanada.ca/2026/10/market-notice-bank-of-canada-expands-access-to-eligible-non-primary-dealer-government-securities-distributors-to-select-market-operations/">
    <title>Bank of Canada Expands Access to Eligible Non-Primary Dealer Government Securities Distributors to Select Market Operations</title>
    <link>https://www.bankofcanada.ca/2026/10/market-notice-bank-of-canada-expands-access-to-eligible-non-primary-dealer-government-securities-distributors-to-select-market-operations/</link>
    <description>Today, the Bank of Canada announced that effective October 30, 2026, non-primary dealer government securities distributors (GSDs) of Government of Canada (GoC) securities may become eligible to participate in select market operations conducted by the Bank, provided they meet certain eligibility requirements.</description>
    <dc:date>2026-10-29T14:00:13+00:00</dc:date>
    <dc:language>en</dc:language>

        <cb:news rdf:parseType="Resource">
            <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.cbwiki.net/wiki/index.php/RSS-CB_1.2_RDF_Schema#Announcement"/>
            <cb:simpleTitle>Bank of Canada Expands Access to Eligible Non-Primary Dealer Government Securities Distributors to Select Market Operations</cb:simpleTitle>
            <cb:occurrenceDate>2026-10-29</cb:occurrenceDate>
        </cb:news>
</item>
<item rdf:about="https://www.bankofcanada.ca/2026/10/bank-canada-webcasts-john-kuszczak-memorial-lecture-2026-10-29/">
    <title>Bank of Canada webcasts The John Kuszczak Memorial Lecture</title>
    <link>https://www.bankofcanada.ca/2026/10/bank-canada-webcasts-john-kuszczak-memorial-lecture-2026-10-29/</link>
    <description>On Thursday, October 29, 2026, the Bank of Canada will host its annual economic conference. This year’s theme is “Global Financial Architecture in Transition: Navigating Currency Shifts, Debt Dynamics, and Digital Innovation”. Academics, policy-makers, private sector economists and representatives from policy think tanks will be among those in attendance.</description>
    <dc:date>2026-10-29T11:30:30+00:00</dc:date>
    <dc:language>en</dc:language>

        <cb:event rdf:parseType="Resource">
            <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.cbwiki.net/wiki/index.php/RSS-CB_1.2_RDF_Schema#Event"/>
            <cb:simpleTitle>Bank of Canada webcasts The John Kuszczak Memorial Lecture</cb:simpleTitle>
            <cb:occurrenceDate>2026-10-29</cb:occurrenceDate>
        </cb:event>
</item>
<item rdf:about="https://www.bankofcanada.ca/multimedia/john-kuszczak-memorial-lecture-2026-10-29/">
    <title>John Kuszczak Memorial Lecture 2026</title>
    <link>https://www.bankofcanada.ca/multimedia/john-kuszczak-memorial-lecture-2026-10-29/</link>
    <description>The Policy Implications of Pseudonymous Stablecoins  — Address by Gita Gopinath,  Harvard University, with introductory remarks by Nicolas Vincent, Deputy Governor.</description>
    <dc:date>2026-10-29T11:30:11+00:00</dc:date>
    <dc:language>en</dc:language>

        <cb:news rdf:parseType="Resource">
            <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.cbwiki.net/wiki/index.php/RSS-CB_1.2_RDF_Schema#Announcement"/>
            <cb:simpleTitle>John Kuszczak Memorial Lecture 2026</cb:simpleTitle>
            <cb:occurrenceDate>2026-10-29</cb:occurrenceDate>
        </cb:news>
</item>
